homepage            https://xgo.dev

description         XGo (formerly Go+): designed for data science

long_description    XGo, formerly Go+, is a statically-typed language \
                    designed for data science. It is fully compatible with \
                    the Go language, but has a more script-like style, \
                    being more readable code for data science than Go.

categories          lang devel
